```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "unpin a law meme: its run leaves the pin set"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.law.unpins"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.law.unpins"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.law.unpins"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.law.unpins ~ a law meme taken out of the pin set

The title's `[[uri]]` run leaves the pin set (`$:/config/lares/law/pins`); a title a broader run still names (a Mu member) takes a `-[[uri]]` run instead. The set lands through `tiddler_put` in this face's working layer of its daemon wiki, against the base it read, keeping its layout; house canon takes no byte.

A title not pinned answers `decision: "noop"`; a pin set that moved under the read refuses `law-pins-moved` (call again). The answer carries {title, uri, decision, pinned, text, hash, bag}.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ unpin-a-mu-member

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`unpin-a-mu-member` params=`uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/mu/chao ~ drop one Mu member from the pins`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ uri · face

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`uri` params=`takes/lar-address needs/required seat/1 ~ the law meme by its lar: address, one title with no whitespace, brackets, braces or bar`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the pin set lands in the face's own working layer through the tiddler door, against the base it read; house canon takes no byte; reversible and trusted, so the seat runs it on the operator's loop`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ law-pins-moved · usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`law-pins-moved` params=`cure/[[engine.law.unpins uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/mu/chao]] ~ the pin set moved since the read; run the unpin again`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.law.unpins uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/mu/chao]] ~ name the law meme by its lar: address; one title with no whitespace, brackets, braces or bar`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ unpinned · noop

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`unpinned` params=`exit/0 fields/[[title uri decision pinned text hash bag]] ~ the pin set landed with the title out of it; decision reads put`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`noop` params=`exit/0 ~ the title already stands unpinned; the pin set moved nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

