!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares law unpin

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares law unpin]] ~ the terminal; the law meme rides as <uri>`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

